# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Python, for the ML service in ml/
.venv
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Secrets -- never commit. Contains the database password and the
# JWT_SECRET that signs umpire logins; anyone holding the latter can
# forge a login as any umpire. Only .env.example belongs in git.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Database dumps from scripts/backup-data.mjs. These contain umpire
# password hashes and player CLAIM CODES, which are bearer credentials
# -- anyone holding one can sign in as that player. One was committed
# once already; never again.
paddlepad-backup.json
*-backup.json

# Claude Code's local state. The permission allowlist says what may run
# without asking on THIS machine, which is a decision for whoever is
# sitting at it -- committing one would hand everybody who clones the
# repo an allowlist they never agreed to. RESUME.md is a session
# checkpoint and is stale the moment it is written.
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/RESUME.md

# Agent skills and design context installed on this machine only: the
# find-skills and task-observer skills (and the lock file recording where
# they came from), and Impeccable's PRODUCT.md product brief, DESIGN.md style guide and
# .impeccable/ working files.
.agents/
.claude/skills/
skills-lock.json
PRODUCT.md
DESIGN.md
.impeccable/
